! Number of Continuation 2   ! Continuation Count
!
! problem type definition
!
CHEM   ! Turn on Gas Chemistry
COMP   ! Fixed Composition for Inlet Species
ENRG   ! Solve Gas Energy Equation
MULT   ! Use Multicomponent Transport
STST   ! Steady State Solver
TDIF   ! Use Thermal Diffusion (Soret Effect)
TRCE   ! Use Trace Species Approximation
!
! physical property
!
OMEG 450.0   ! Disk Rotation Rate (rpm)
PRES 0.26315789   ! Pressure (atm)
REOR   ! Assign Error to Largest Species
TDSK 923.15   ! Surface Temperature (K)
TINL 295.0   ! Inlet Temperature (K)
TPRO 0.0 923.0   ! Temperature (K)
TPRO 6.2 295.0   ! Temperature (K)
!
! reactor dimension definition
!
NPTS 15.0   ! Number of Grid Points
XEND 6.2   ! Ending Axial Position (cm)
!
! species property
!
BULK SI(D) 1.0   ! Bulk Activity (mole fraction)
REAC HE 199.89   ! Reactant Fraction (mole fraction)
REAC SIH4 0.11   ! Reactant Fraction (mole fraction)
SURF SI(S) 0.05   ! Surface Fraction (site fraction)
SURF SIH(S) 0.95   ! Surface Fraction (site fraction)
END
